- [Viewer API](https://docs.brandfetch.com/reference/viewer-api.md): Returns the identity of the credential used to authenticate the request: an API key or a user session token (JWT). Use it to verify a credential during integration setup (a `200` response means the credential is valid; `401`/`403` means it is missing, unknown, or revoked) and to display which API ke…
