- [Guide to Logo Fair use](https://docs.brandfetch.com/guides/logo-fair-use.md): Understanding fair use principles for logo usage
- [Overview](https://docs.brandfetch.com/use-cases/overview.md): Common use cases for brand data, each with a working example
- [Sales personalization](https://docs.brandfetch.com/use-cases/sales-personalization.md): Auto-brand decks, proposals, and emails with your prospect's logo and colors
- [Populate onboarding](https://docs.brandfetch.com/use-cases/populate-onboarding.md): Boost conversion and activation by personalizing your users' onboarding from their email domain
- [Company autocomplete](https://docs.brandfetch.com/use-cases/company-autocomplete.md): Find your company as you type, with a logo on every result, powered by the Brand Search API
- [Profiles & directory](https://docs.brandfetch.com/use-cases/profiles-and-directory.md): Put verified logos and brand data on every company record, in account lists, CRM contacts, job listings, and logo walls
- [Logo picker](https://docs.brandfetch.com/use-cases/logo-picker.md): Let users search a brand and drop the right logo asset into the document, powered by the Brand Search API and Brand API
- [Transaction enrichment](https://docs.brandfetch.com/use-cases/transaction-enrichment.md): Turn raw payment descriptors into clean merchant identity, category, and logo using the Transaction API
- [Stock ticker logos](https://docs.brandfetch.com/use-cases/stock-ticker-logos.md): Show company logos in stock watchlists and portfolio cards using the Logo API's ticker route
- [On-brand AI](https://docs.brandfetch.com/use-cases/on-brand-ai.md): Ground LLMs and agents with real brand context using the Brand Context API and Brandfetch MCP
